-From: Sven Eckelmann <sven@narfation.org>
-Subject: batman-adv: Avoid double-rtnl_lock ELP metric worker
-
-Backport upstream commit cfc83a3c71517b59c1047db57da31e26a9dc2f33.
-The wireless ELP metric worker must use rtnl_trylock because interface
-removal holds RTNL while synchronously cancelling that worker.
-
